@startuml

title Exercise 3: Precharge with a timeout

participant "Vehicle ECU" as ECU
participant "BMS" as BMS
participant "Precharge relay" as PRE
participant "Main contactor" as MAIN

ECU -> BMS : Close contactor
BMS -> PRE : Close

loop every 10 ms, at most 300 ms
    BMS -> BMS : Measure bus voltage
end

alt bus voltage reached 95% of pack voltage
    BMS -> MAIN : Close
    BMS -> PRE : Open
    BMS --> ECU : Contactor closed
else
    BMS -> PRE: Open
    BMS --> ECU : Precharge fault
end

note right of BMS : Requirement REQ_004

@enduml